  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:370px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Malevorous</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Spike_the_Devil_Man_%28Dragon_Ball%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20120615230727\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Spike the Devil Man (Dragon Ball)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Spike_the_Devil_Man_%28Dragon_Ball%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120615230727\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Spike_the_Devil_Man_%28Dragon_Ball%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120615230727 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Spike_the_Devil_Man_%28Dragon_Ball%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20120615230727 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Spike the Devil Man (Dragon Ball)\" width=\"270\" height=\"200\" data-image-key=\"Spike_the_Devil_Man_%28Dragon_Ball%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Spike the Devil Man (Dragon Ball).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Spike the Devil Man (Dragon Ball) can feed on emotions such as fear, anger, hatred, jealousy, and aggression and use them as energy to bolster his physical traits or form them into beams of destructive power.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Feed on the darkness of people.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>feed on the darkness of people's hearts and become better physically</b>. Variation to <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Benevorous\" title=\"Benevorous\">Benevorous</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Evil_Empowerment\" title=\"Evil Empowerment\">Evil Empowerment</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sin_Eating\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sin Eating\">Sin Eating</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Evil/Malevolence/Malice Consumption/Feeding/Metabolization/Hunger</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can feed on the darkness of people's hearts, gaining boosts to stamina, strength, durability, and speed, depending on the level of evil and malevolence in a foe, to boost their physical traits. This power automatically scans for the worst malicious intent to feed off of when facing multiple foes. Foes need not have actual powers; a sociopathic serial killer could give the user a boost to their physical traits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Feed on evil and negative energies inside the hearts and minds of opponents.</li>\n<li>Turn a foe's evil nature to your gain.</li>\n<li>The evil the user feeds off of can come from a super-powerless but corrupted person.</li>\n<li>An <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/AntiHero\">anti-hero</a> can still give the user a slight boost to their physical traits.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Not very effective against those who are mostly heroic or at least <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/TrueNeutral\">neutral</a>\n<ul><li>Worthless on foes that are <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/IncorruptiblePurePureness\">pure good</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May be inherently useless on beings who are child-like with no sense or knowledge of the concepts of right and wrong.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Absorption\" title=\"Aura Absorption\">Aura Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evil_Empowerment\" title=\"Evil Empowerment\">Evil Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Malefic Force Manipulation\">Malefic Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Morality_Empowerment\" title=\"Morality Empowerment\">Morality Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Negative_Emotion_Empowerment\" title=\"Negative Emotion Empowerment\">Negative Emotion Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sin_Eating\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sin Eating\">Sin Eating</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Terumi Yuuki (<i>Blazblue</i>); via Morality Empowerment</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Negative_Speed_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Negative Speed Force\">Negative Speed Force</a> Users (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Red_Lantern_Corps\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Red Lantern Corps\">Red Lantern Corps</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Orange_Lantern_Corps\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Orange Lantern Corps\">Orange Lantern Corps</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Sinestro_Corps\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Sinestro Corps\">Sinestro Corps</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Spike_the_Devil_Man\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Spike the Devil Man\">Spike the Devil Man</a> (<i>Dragon Ball</i>)</li>\n<li>Spawn (<i>Image Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Ansem, Seeker of Darkness (<i>Kingdom Hearts</i>)</li>\n<li>Caldea's Orb (<i>Marchen Awakens Romance</i>)</li>\n<li>Sin-Eater (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Dark Kahn (<i>Mortal Kombat vs. DC Universe)</i></li>\n<li>Shinnō (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Zero-Tails (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>HIM (<i>The Powerpuff Girls</i>)</li>\n<li>Garuda (<i>Street Fighter series)</i></li>\n<li>The Bubbler (<i>Thundercats</i>)</li>\n<li>Neuro Nōgami (<i>Neuro: Supernatural Detective</i>)</li>\n<li>Master Moo (<i>Monster Rancher</i> anime)</li>\n<li>Sirens (<i>The Vampire Diaries</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMalevorous%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"8fdc1e43b5b900f2c2d84a8e275c690c\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Orange_Lantern_Corps-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:194px; width:126px; top: